#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:2
msgid "Manual Installation"
msgstr "수동 설치"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:8
msgid ""
"The `CodeIgniter 4 framework "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/framework>`_ repository holds the "
"released versions of the framework. It is intended for developers who do "
"not wish to use Composer."
msgstr ""
"`CodeIgniter 4 프레임워크 <https://github.com/codeigniter4/framework>`_ "
"저장소에는 프레임워크의 출시 버전이 포함되어 있습니다. Composer를 사용하지 않으려는 개발자를 위한 방법입니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:12
msgid ""
"Develop your app inside the **app** folder, and the **public** folder "
"will be your public-facing document root. Do not change anything inside "
"the **system** folder!"
msgstr ""
"**app** 폴더 안에서 앱을 개발하고, **public** 폴더가 외부에 공개되는 문서 루트가 됩니다. "
"**system** 폴더 안의 내용은 절대 변경하지 마세요!"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:16
msgid ""
"This is the installation technique closest to that described for "
"`CodeIgniter 3 "
"<https://codeigniter.com/userguide3/installation/index.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"이 설치 방법은 `CodeIgniter 3 "
"<https://codeigniter.com/userguide3/installation/index.html>`_\\ 에 설명된 "
"방법과 가장 유사합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:20
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "설치"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:22
msgid ""
"Download the `latest version "
"<https://github.com/CodeIgniter4/framework/releases/latest>`_, and "
"extract it to become your project root."
msgstr ""
"`최신 버전 <https://github.com/CodeIgniter4/framework/releases/latest>`_\\ 을 "
"다운로드하고 프로젝트 루트가 될 위치에 압축을 해제하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:25
msgid ""
"Before v4.4.0, CodeIgniter autoloader did not allow special characters "
"that are illegal in filenames on certain operating systems. The symbols "
"that can be used are ``/``, ``_``, ``.``, ``:``, ``\\`` and space. So if "
"you installed CodeIgniter under the folder that contains the special "
"characters like ``(``, ``)``, etc., CodeIgniter didn't work. Since "
"v4.4.0, this restriction has been removed."
msgstr ""
"v4.4.0 이전의 CodeIgniter 오토로더는 특정 운영체제의 파일 이름에서 허용되지 않는 특수 문자를 허용하지 않았습니다. "
"사용할 수 있는 기호는 ``/``, ``_``, ``.``, ``:``, ``\\`` 및 공백이었습니다. 따라서 ``(``, "
"``)`` 등과 같은 특수 문자가 포함된 폴더 아래에 CodeIgniter를 설치하면 작동하지 않았습니다. v4.4.0부터 이 "
"제한이 제거되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:33
msgid "Initial Configuration"
msgstr "초기 설정"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:35
msgid ""
"After installation, a few initial configurations are required. See :ref"
":`initial-configuration` for the detail."
msgstr ""
"설치 후 몇 가지 초기 설정이 필요합니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`initial-configuration`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:41
msgid "Upgrading"
msgstr "업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:43
msgid ""
"Download a new copy of the framework, and then replace the **system** "
"folder."
msgstr "프레임워크의 새 사본을 다운로드하고 **system** 폴더를 교체하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:45
msgid ""
"Read the :doc:`upgrade instructions <upgrading>` and :doc:`change log "
"<../changelogs/index>`, and check Breaking Changes and Enhancements."
msgstr ""
":doc:`업그레이드 지침 <upgrading>` 및 :doc:`변경 로그 <../changelogs/index>`\\ 를 읽고 "
"호환성이 중단되는 변경 사항(Breaking Changes)과 개선 사항을 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:49
msgid "Pros"
msgstr "장점"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:51
msgid "Download and run."
msgstr "다운로드하고 실행."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:54
msgid "Cons"
msgstr "단점"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:56
msgid ""
"You need to check for file changes in the **project space** (root, app, "
"public, tests, writable) and merge them by yourself."
msgstr ""
"**프로젝트 공간**(루트, app, public, tests, writable)의 파일 변경 사항을 직접 확인하고 병합해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:60
msgid "Structure"
msgstr "구조"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:62
msgid "Folders in your project after set up:"
msgstr "설정 후 프로젝트의 폴더 구조:"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:64
msgid "app, public, tests, writable, system"
msgstr "app, public, tests, writable, system"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:67
msgid "Translations Installation"
msgstr "번역 설치"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:69
msgid ""
"If you want to take advantage of the system message translations, they "
"can be added to your project in a similar fashion."
msgstr "시스템 메시지 번역을 활용하려면 비슷한 방법으로 프로젝트에 추가할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:72
msgid ""
"Download the `latest version of them "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/translations/releases/latest>`_. Extract"
" the downloaded zip, and copy the **Language** folder contents in it to "
"your **app/Languages** folder."
msgstr ""
"`최신 버전 <https://github.com/codeigniter4/translations/releases/latest>`_\\ 을 "
"다운로드하세요. 다운로드한 zip 파일을 압축 해제하고 그 안의 **Language** 폴더 내용을 "
"**app/Languages** 폴더에 복사하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:76
msgid ""
"This would need to be repeated to incorporate any updates to the "
"translations."
msgstr "번역 업데이트를 반영하려면 이 과정을 반복해야 합니다."
